rm Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 34; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, threejs, charts, billing, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nEnterprise Telemetry Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nOperational Telemetry // Sector Alpha Orchestrating enterprise velocity through unified intelligence. Institutional scale requires zero-latency alignment across all operational vectors. We fuse capital flow, infrastruct…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Orchestrating enterprise velocity through unified intelligence.; Algorithmic capital reconciliation.; Predictive infrastructure orchestration.; Frictionless deployment pipelines.; Holistic executive telemetry..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #60A5FA, secondary #030712, accent #10B981, background #030712, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Enterprise Telemetry // Sector Alpha</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;300;400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;300&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030712] text-zinc-300 font-['Inter',sans-serif] antialiased selection:bg-blue-500/30 selection:text-white relative min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n\n    <!-- Atmospheric Backdrop Glows -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.25) 0%, transparent 40%), radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(88, 28, 135, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.01)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:3rem_3rem] [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,white_10%,transparent_90%)]\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Constrained Panel -->\n    <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full border-x border-white/5 bg-[#030712]/60 backdrop-blur-2xl relative z-10 flex-grow shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n\n        <!-- Registration Marks -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/20 z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/20 z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/20 z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/20 z-20\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Vertical Grid Lines inside Panel -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 border-l border-white/5 hidden lg:block pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"px-6 py-24 lg:px-20 lg:py-40 border-b border-white/5 relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-blue-400 mb-8 flex items-center tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-light opacity-80\">\n                    <span class=\"w-8 h-px bg-blue-400/50 mr-4\"></span>\n                    Operational Telemetry // Sector Alpha\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-thin tracking-tight text-white leading-tight\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out\">Orchestrating</span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out delay-75\">enterprise</span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out delay-150\">velocity</span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out delay-200\">through</span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-blue-200 to-slate-400 delay-300\">unified intelligence.</span>\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"max-w-xs border-l border-white/10 pl-6\">\n                <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                    Institutional scale requires zero-latency alignment across all operational vectors. We fuse capital flow, infrastructure, and engineering data into a centralized command surface.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Content Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 relative z-10\">\n\n            <!-- Quadrant 01: Finance -->\n            <section class=\"p-8 lg:p-16 border-b border-white/5 lg:border-r group relative transition-colors duration-1000 hover:bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-400/0 group-hover:bg-blue-400/[0.02] transition-colors duration-1000 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-16\">\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-500 uppercase font-light\">01 // Capital_Allocation</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-blue-400/80 uppercase tracking-widest\">Ledger_Sync</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Glass UI Component -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group-hover:border-blue-400/20 group-hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-700 shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-400/10 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 mb-8 uppercase tracking-wide\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pie-chart-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-blue-400 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-500\"></iconify-icon> Capital Flow\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/10 mb-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full bg-blue-400 w-[62%] group-hover:bg-blue-300 transition-colors shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(96,165,250,0.5)]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[62%] h-full bg-zinc-600 w-[18%]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-8 uppercase tracking-wider font-light\">\n                            <span>Deployed</span>\n                            <span>Liquid</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"space-y-4 font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-xs\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-white/5 font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest font-light\">\n                                <span>Asset Class</span><span>Volume</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 font-light flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(96,165,250,0.8)]\"></span> Recurring ARR\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-zinc-400 font-light\">$2.4M</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 font-light flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-600\"></span> Block Contracts\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-zinc-400 font-light\">$840K</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-light text-zinc-100 mb-4 tracking-tight\">Algorithmic capital reconciliation.</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-12\">\n                    Autonomous normalization of revenue streams and billing cadences, bypassing manual pipeline audits with cryptographically verifiable ledgers.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-6 mt-auto\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=1\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full grayscale opacity-50 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-700 border border-white/10\" alt=\"Sarah J.\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest font-light\">S. Jenkins</span>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-600 uppercase font-light tracking-wide\">Auth // VP Finance</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Quadrant 02: Operations -->\n            <section class=\"p-8 lg:p-16 border-b border-white/5 group relative transition-colors duration-1000 hover:bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-400/0 group-hover:bg-blue-400/[0.02] transition-colors duration-1000 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-16\">\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-500 uppercase font-light\">02 // Operations</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-blue-400/80 uppercase tracking-widest\">Infra_Scale</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Glass UI Component -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group-hover:border-blue-400/20 group-hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-700 shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n\n                    <div class=\"border border-white/5 bg-[#030712]/50 p-4 mb-4 flex justify-between items-center rounded-lg\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase font-light tracking-wide\">Load Distribution</span>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(16,185,129,0.8)]\"></span> Optimized</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"border border-white/5 bg-[#030712]/80 rounded-lg flex flex-col\">\n                        <div class=\"border-b border-white/5 px-4 py-3 flex gap-4 text-zinc-600\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-5 font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-loose font-light\">\n                            <span class=\"text-blue-400\">root@cluster-01</span>:~# sys_check<br>\n                            > uptime SLA: <span class=\"text-zinc-200\">99.999%</span><br>\n                            > failover status: <span class=\"text-zinc-200\">standby</span><br>\n                            > latency [p99]: <span class=\"text-zinc-200\">12ms</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-light text-zinc-100 mb-4 tracking-tight\">Predictive infrastructure orchestration.</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-12\">\n                    Elastically provision compute resources based on predictive load models, neutralizing latency risks before they surface in user telemetry.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-6 mt-auto\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=2\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full grayscale opacity-50 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-700 border border-white/10\" alt=\"Marcus T.\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest font-light\">M. Torres</span>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-600 uppercase font-light tracking-wide\">Auth // Head of Ops</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Quadrant 03: Engineering -->\n            <section class=\"p-8 lg:p-16 border-b lg:border-b-0 border-white/5 lg:border-r group relative transition-colors duration-1000 hover:bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-400/0 group-hover:bg-blue-400/[0.02] transition-colors duration-1000 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-16\">\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-500 uppercase font-light\">03 // Engineering</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-blue-400/80 uppercase tracking-widest\">Data_Sync</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Glass UI Component -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group-hover:border-blue-400/20 group-hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-700 shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-white/5\">\n                        <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 uppercase flex items-center gap-3 tracking-wide\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:branching-paths-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-zinc-500 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-500\"></iconify-icon> Pipeline Routing\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-500 flex items-center gap-2 uppercase font-light\">\n                            v.2.4.1\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"space-y-5 font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs font-light\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-600 tracking-wide\">INGEST_NODE</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-300 border border-white/5 px-3 py-1 bg-[#030712]/50 rounded text-[10px] tracking-wider\">Kafka_Stream</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-600 tracking-wide\">SYNC_MODE</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex border border-white/5 bg-[#030712]/50 rounded overflow-hidden text-[10px] tracking-wider\">\n                                <span class=\"text-blue-400 px-3 py-1 border-r border-white/5 bg-blue-400/10\">Duplex</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-500 px-3 py-1\">Simplex</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-600 tracking-wide\">STATE_RES</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-400 text-[10px] tracking-wider border-b border-zinc-700 border-dashed pb-0.5\">Deterministic</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-light text-zinc-100 mb-4 tracking-tight\">Frictionless deployment pipelines.</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-12\">\n                    Deprecate brittle integration scripts in favor of automated, declarative deployment schemas that guarantee zero-downtime rollouts.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-6 mt-auto\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=3\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full grayscale opacity-50 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-700 border border-white/10\" alt=\"David K.\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest font-light\">D. Kim</span>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-600 uppercase font-light tracking-wide\">Auth // VP Engineering</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Quadrant 04: Leadership -->\n            <section class=\"p-8 lg:p-16 group relative transition-colors duration-1000 hover:bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-400/0 group-hover:bg-blue-400/[0.02] transition-colors duration-1000 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-16\">\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-500 uppercase font-light\">04 // Leadership</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-blue-400/80 uppercase tracking-widest\">Exec_Telemetry</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Glass UI Component -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group-hover:border-blue-400/20 group-hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-700 shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-48 h-24 bg-blue-500/10 blur-3xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"border border-white/5 p-4 bg-[#030712]/50 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between h-28 hover:bg-[#030712]/80 transition-colors\">\n                            <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-[10px] text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Active Nodes</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-xl font-light text-zinc-200\">1,048</span>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/5 mt-2 relative\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-blue-400 w-[92%] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(96,165,250,0.4)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-white/5 p-4 bg-[#030712]/50 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between h-28 hover:bg-[#030712]/80 transition-colors\">\n                            <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-[10px] text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Sys Load</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-xl font-light text-zinc-200\">18%</span>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/5 mt-2 relative\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-zinc-500 w-[18%]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"border border-white/5 p-4 bg-[#030712]/50 rounded-lg flex flex-col gap-3 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-[10px] text-zinc-400 uppercase flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 tracking-widest font-light\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:info-circle-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-zinc-500\"></iconify-icon> System Notices\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2 font-light\">\n                            <span>Capacity scaling [EU-W]</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-zinc-600 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-500 flex justify-between items-center font-light\">\n                            <span>API utilization nominal</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-light text-zinc-100 mb-4 tracking-tight\">Holistic executive telemetry.</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-12\">\n                    Surface critical operational bottlenecks through a macroscopic lens, correlating real-time system performance directly to revenue impact.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-6 mt-auto\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=4\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full grayscale opacity-50 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-700 border border-white/10\" alt=\"Elena M.\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest font-light\">E. Mercer</span>\n                        <span class=\"font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-zinc-600 uppercase font-light tracking-wide\">Auth // Chief Executive</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "enterprise-telemetry-sector-alpha.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/enterprise-telemetry-sector-alpha.jpg", "source_name": "enterprise-telemetry-sector-alpha-DESIGN.md", "views": 80, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T07:40:26.471058+00:00"}